    "problem": "This paper addresses the challenge of understanding the underlying dynamic mechanisms, particularly changes in synoptic-scale cyclone activity, that drive the projected reduction of critical winter precipitation in the Mediterranean Basin, a region highly vulnerable to future climate change.",
    "method": "This study uses time-slice simulations from the ECHAM5 model to investigate future winter climate changes in the Mediterranean Basin by comparing a future A2 scenario simulation (2071-2100) with a control simulation (1961-1990) to understand the underlying dynamical background of synoptic variability.",
    "task": "The task is to investigate changes in winter synoptic-scale variability over the Mediterranean Basin under future A2 climate conditions by analyzing simulations from the ECHAM5 model and comparing them to a control period.",
